{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，Y在S02、S07、S09等处压缩了人物犹豫的因果过程，尤其没有像X那样充分交代当初为什么离开、如今为什么又感到孤单。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的主线表达更短，重点有明显视觉锚点，感受又通过音乐时点逐步出现，观众比较容易一边听一边抓住正在发生什么。反复出现的亲近、失去、孤独、重新向前等意象，也让音乐细节与人物经历形成了更紧密的整体联系；尤其在音乐质感和情绪转折的具体呈现上，Y明显比X细腻。不过，Y有些地方为了压缩表达牺牲了人物动机的完整性，X在解释他为什么离开、为什么舍不得、为什么不敢回头方面更扎实。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "0252e4fe-11ec-417d-8ddb-82c9aaeea083", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261106T224909165182Z", "elapsed_seconds": 75.859, "completed_utc": "2026-11-06T22:50:25.029804+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e382139133351e80e047f330b2ffb8890056245947d3bd0ff435265906eada71", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\ch